{"seq":1,"slug":"rest-principles","title":"REST 设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/rest-principles","wordCount":932,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rest-设计原则\">REST 设计原则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>REST（Representational State Transfer）是 Roy Fielding 在 2000 年博士论文中提出的架构风格。它不是协议也不是标准，而是一组<strong>约束条件</strong>。满足这些约束的系统被称为 RESTful。REST 的核心洞察是：Web 本身就是一个巨型分布式系统，其成功的架构原则可以推广到 API 设计中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[REST 架构约束] --&gt; B[客户端-服务器]&#10;    A --&gt; C[无状态]&#10;    A --&gt; D[可缓存]&#10;    A --&gt; E[统一接口]&#10;    A --&gt; F[分层系统]&#10;    A --&gt; G[按需代码]&#10;    E --&gt; H[资源标识]&#10;    E --&gt; I[表述操作]&#10;    E --&gt; J[自描述消息]&#10;    E --&gt; K[超媒体驱动]\">graph TD\n    A[REST 架构约束] --&gt; B[客户端-服务器]\n    A --&gt; C[无状态]\n    A --&gt; D[可缓存]\n    A --&gt; E[统一接口]\n    A --&gt; F[分层系统]\n    A --&gt; G[按需代码]\n    E --&gt; H[资源标识]\n    E --&gt; I[表述操作]\n    E --&gt; J[自描述消息]\n    E --&gt; K[超媒体驱动]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>REST 约束</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>好处</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端-服务器</td>\n<td>关注点分离</td>\n<td>独立演进</td>\n<td>接口约定成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无状态</td>\n<td>每次请求包含全部信息</td>\n<td>水平扩展</td>\n<td>请求体积增大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可缓存</td>\n<td>响应标记是否可缓存</td>\n<td>减少网络交互</td>\n<td>缓存一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一接口</td>\n<td>标准化资源操作</td>\n<td>简化架构</td>\n<td>效率损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层系统</td>\n<td>客户端不知道中间层</td>\n<td>负载均衡、安全</td>\n<td>延迟增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按需代码</td>\n<td>服务器可发送可执行代码</td>\n<td>动态扩展</td>\n<td>安全风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"http-方法语义\">HTTP 方法语义</h2><p>REST 将 HTTP 方法映射到 CRUD 操作，但这不仅仅是命名约定——每个方法有明确的<strong>安全性</strong>和<strong>幂等性</strong>语义。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface HttpMethod {&#10;  method: string;&#10;  safe: boolean;&#10;  idempotent: boolean;&#10;  requestBody: boolean;&#10;  typicalStatusCodes: number[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const methods: HttpMethod[] = [&#10;  { method: &#39;GET&#39;, safe: true, idempotent: true, requestBody: false, typicalStatusCodes: [200, 304, 404] },&#10;  { method: &#39;POST&#39;, safe: false, idempotent: false, requestBody: true, typicalStatusCodes: [201, 400, 409] },&#10;  { method: &#39;PUT&#39;, safe: false, idempotent: true, requestBody: true, typicalStatusCodes: [200, 204, 404] },&#10;  { method: &#39;PATCH&#39;, safe: false, idempotent: false, requestBody: true, typicalStatusCodes: [200, 204, 404] },&#10;  { method: &#39;DELETE&#39;, safe: false, idempotent: true, requestBody: false, typicalStatusCodes: [204, 404] },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  safe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  idempotent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requestBody</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  typicalStatusCodes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> methods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, safe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idempotent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requestBody: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typicalStatusCodes: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">304</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, safe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idempotent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requestBody: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typicalStatusCodes: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">409</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, safe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idempotent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requestBody: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typicalStatusCodes: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, safe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idempotent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requestBody: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typicalStatusCodes: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DELETE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, safe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idempotent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requestBody: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typicalStatusCodes: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>安全方法</strong>（GET, HEAD, OPTIONS）不修改服务器状态，可以被安全重试和缓存。<strong>幂等方法</strong>（GET, PUT, DELETE）多次执行的效果与一次相同——这对网络不稳定时的重试至关重要。</p>\n<p>PUT 和 PATCH 的区别常被混淆。PUT 是<strong>完整替换</strong>——发送资源的完整表述；PATCH 是<strong>部分更新</strong>——只发送要修改的字段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// PUT: 完整替换&#10;// PUT /users/123&#10;const putBody = {&#10;  id: 123,&#10;  name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;  email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;,&#10;  role: &#39;admin&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;// PATCH: 部分更新&#10;// PATCH /users/123&#10;const patchBody = {&#10;  role: &#39;admin&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUT: 完整替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUT /users/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> putBody</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">123</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  email: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PATCH: 部分更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PATCH /users/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> patchBody</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"url-设计规范\">URL 设计规范</h2><p>URL 是 REST API 的门面——好的 URL 设计让 API 不言自明。核心原则是 <strong>URL 表示资源（名词），HTTP 方法表示操作（动词）</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"✅ 正确&#10;GET    /users                 获取用户列表&#10;GET    /users/123             获取单个用户&#10;POST   /users                 创建用户&#10;PUT    /users/123             更新用户&#10;DELETE /users/123             删除用户&#10;GET    /users/123/orders      获取用户的订单&#10;GET    /users/123/orders/456  获取特定订单&#10;&#10;❌ 错误&#10;GET    /getUsers              动词出现在 URL 中&#10;POST   /createUser            动词出现在 URL 中&#10;GET    /user/123              单数（应复数）&#10;DELETE /users/123/delete      delete 既出现在方法又出现在 URL\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>✅ 正确</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /users                 获取用户列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /users/123             获取单个用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST   /users                 创建用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PUT    /users/123             更新用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DELETE /users/123             删除用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /users/123/orders      获取用户的订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /users/123/orders/456  获取特定订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ 错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /getUsers              动词出现在 URL 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST   /createUser            动词出现在 URL 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET    /user/123              单数（应复数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DELETE /users/123/delete      delete 既出现在方法又出现在 URL</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface UrlConvention {&#10;  rule: string;&#10;  example: string;&#10;  reason: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const conventions: UrlConvention[] = [&#10;  { rule: &#39;使用复数名词&#39;, example: &#39;/users, /orders&#39;, reason: &#39;集合语义一致&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;kebab-case&#39;, example: &#39;/user-profiles&#39;, reason: &#39;URL 不区分大小写&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;嵌套不超过 2 层&#39;, example: &#39;/users/123/orders&#39;, reason: &#39;深嵌套难以理解&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;查询用 Query String&#39;, example: &#39;/users?role=admin&amp;sort=name&#39;, reason: &#39;过滤非路径的一部分&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;版本在路径或 Header&#39;, example: &#39;/v1/users&#39;, reason: &#39;向后兼容&#39; },&#10;  { rule: &#39;分页用标准参数&#39;, example: &#39;?page=2&amp;per_page=20&#39;, reason: &#39;可预测的接口&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UrlConvention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> conventions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UrlConvention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'使用复数名词'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users, /orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'集合语义一致'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kebab-case'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/user-profiles'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'URL 不区分大小写'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'嵌套不超过 2 层'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/123/orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'深嵌套难以理解'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'查询用 Query String'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users?role=admin&#x26;sort=name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'过滤非路径的一部分'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'版本在路径或 Header'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/v1/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'向后兼容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { rule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分页用标准参数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'?page=2&#x26;per_page=20'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可预测的接口'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态码最佳实践\">状态码最佳实践</h2><p>HTTP 状态码是 REST 的语义载体。正确使用状态码让客户端无需解析响应体就能理解请求的结果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>200 OK</td>\n<td>成功</td>\n<td>GET/PUT/PATCH 成功</td>\n<td>用于所有成功（应区分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>201 Created</td>\n<td>已创建</td>\n<td>POST 成功创建</td>\n<td>忽略，统一返回 200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>204 No Content</td>\n<td>无内容</td>\n<td>DELETE 成功</td>\n<td>不返回此码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>400 Bad Request</td>\n<td>请求格式错误</td>\n<td>参数校验失败</td>\n<td>与 422 混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>401 Unauthorized</td>\n<td>未认证</td>\n<td>缺少认证信息</td>\n<td>与 403 混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>403 Forbidden</td>\n<td>无权限</td>\n<td>已认证但无权限</td>\n<td>与 401 混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>404 Not Found</td>\n<td>资源不存在</td>\n<td>请求不存在的资源</td>\n<td>作为通用错误码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>409 Conflict</td>\n<td>冲突</td>\n<td>并发更新冲突</td>\n<td>忽略不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>422 Unprocessable</td>\n<td>语义错误</td>\n<td>业务规则校验失败</td>\n<td>统一用 400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>429 Too Many Req</td>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>超出请求配额</td>\n<td>忽略限流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ApiResponse&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  data: T;&#10;  meta?: PaginationMeta;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ApiError {&#10;  error: {&#10;    code: string;&#10;    message: string;&#10;    details?: ErrorDetail[];&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ErrorDetail {&#10;  field: string;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  code: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createErrorResponse = (status: number, code: string, message: string, details?: ErrorDetail[]): Response =&gt; {&#10;  const body: ApiError = {&#10;    error: { code, message, details },&#10;  };&#10;  return new Response(JSON.stringify(body), {&#10;    status,&#10;    headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApiResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  meta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaginationMeta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line